# darksamus_attacks.py's driver (25 frames apart). `uevent <id> <type> <dt>`: the dt is the key; each
# line starts with the save (130) and ends with the put-back (199), both on DamageOff (9), which
# returns at once. Types: 0 Projectile, 8 DamageOn, 37 (the enrage sphere's reset).
