@f625 uevent u04f7 9 130; place u04f7 player 1; uevent u04f7 9 122; uevent u04f7 8 101; uevent u04f7 8 101; uevent u04f7 9 122; uevent u04f7 9 120; uevent u04f7 8 102; uevent u04f7 9 199
